Original code:
```csharp
        public bool IsCrawling()
        {
            var response =
                ApiHandler.CallAction<DefaultResponse<bool>>(Device, "/linkcrawler/isCrawling", null, JDownloaderHandler.LoginObject);
            if (response?.Data == null)
                return false;

            return response.Data;
        }
```
Solution:
```csharp
        public bool IsCrawling()
        {
            var response =
                ApiHandler.CallAction<DefaultResponse<bool>>(Device, "/linkcrawler/isCrawling", null, JDownloaderHandler.LoginObject, true);
            if (response?.Data == null)
                return false;

            return response.Data;
        }
```

